OL,3,AMonzo says issue with card payments and
OL,4,Atransfers now resolved
OL,5,
OL,6,FMonzo says a technical issue which left
OL,7,Fusers unable to use their card for
OL,8,Fpayments or transfers has now been
OL,9,Fresolved.
OL,11,FThe digital bank had previously posted
OL,12,Fon X it had "identified some issues"
OL,13,Fand activated a stand-in backup service
OL,14,Fwhich meant users could still make
OL,15,Ftransactions like card payments and
OL,16,Fsending and receiving bank transfers.
OL,18,FHowever, some users noted under the
OL,19,Fpost that Monzo Stand-in was "not
OL,20,Fworking as expected" and they could
OL,21,Fstill not use their card.
OL,23,APub: 19-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,117,105,200,160,0,100
